# Smart Search Directory Tree

```
apps/azalee/lib/search/
├── fuzzy-match.ts              # Core fuzzy matching algorithms (150 lines)
│   ├── levenshteinDistance()   # Levenshtein distance calculation
│   ├── similarityScore()       # Similarity score (0-1)
│   ├── isSimilar()             # Threshold-based comparison
│   ├── normalizeText()         # Text normalization (accents, case)
│   ├── findClosestMatch()      # Find best match from candidates
│   ├── getNameVariations()     # Extract multilingual names
│   ├── detectMatchedLanguage() # Detect FR/EN/JP match
│   └── highlightMatches()      # Generate highlight parts for UI
│
