## Maintenance

### To Add a New Feature

1. Add function to `fuzzy-match.ts` or `smart-search.ts`
2. Export from `index.ts`
3. Add test to `search.test.ts`
4. Update `CHANGELOG.md`
5. Add example to `EXAMPLES.md`

### To Update Documentation

1. Update relevant `.md` file
2. Update `CHANGELOG.md` version
3. Update this `.tree` file

